@startuml

title dev fake secret store 設計差分 sequence 図

autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 25
skinparam BoxPadding 10

actor "開発者 / AI 確認者" as Operator
participant "run-wails-agent-browser.sh" as DevScript
participant "newAppController\ninternal/bootstrap/app_controller.go" as AppController
participant "開発用 backend selection helper" as BackendSelector
participant "NewProviderSettingsKeyringSecretStore()" as KeyringStore
participant "NewInMemorySecretStore()" as InMemoryStore
participant "NewCachedProviderSettingsSecretStore()" as CachedStore
participant "ProviderSettingsService" as ProviderSettingsService
participant "master persona / job setup /\n各 phase service" as SharedConsumers
participant "変更しない公開境界\nUI / DTO / Wails / DB / provider catalog" as PublicBoundary

== agent-browser 用開発起動 ==

Operator -> DevScript : npm run dev:wails:agent-browser
DevScript -> DevScript : .env を読む
DevScript -> AppController : agent-browser 用の非 secret 起動条件で起動
AppController -> BackendSelector : provider settings secret backend を選ぶ

alt 開発条件が成立する
    BackendSelector -> InMemoryStore : process-local backend を作る
    InMemoryStore --> BackendSelector : ProviderSettingsSecretStore
    note right of InMemoryStore
    追加予定:
    - provider settings backend として再利用
    - secret は process-local にだけ残る
    end note
else 開発条件が成立しない
    BackendSelector -> KeyringStore : production 既定 backend を作る
    KeyringStore --> BackendSelector : ProviderSettingsSecretStore
end

BackendSelector --> AppController : 選ばれた backend
AppController -> CachedStore : backend を wrap する
CachedStore --> AppController : shared cached store
AppController -> ProviderSettingsService : cached store を注入
AppController -> SharedConsumers : 同じ cached store を注入
ProviderSettingsService -> PublicBoundary : 公開境界は増やさない
SharedConsumers -> PublicBoundary : fake secret store を user-facing に出さない

== production 既定起動 ==

Operator -> AppController : 通常起動
AppController -> BackendSelector : provider settings secret backend を選ぶ
BackendSelector -> KeyringStore : 開発条件なし
KeyringStore --> BackendSelector : keyring backend
BackendSelector --> AppController : production 既定 backend
AppController -> CachedStore : wrapper 役割は変更しない
CachedStore --> AppController : shared cached store
AppController -> ProviderSettingsService : 既存注入を維持
AppController -> SharedConsumers : 既存注入を維持

note right of DevScript
変更予定:
- agent-browser 用に keyring を開かない条件を渡す候補

禁止:
- secret 値や key を script へ書かない
end note

note right of PublicBoundary
変更しない:
- provider settings UI
- 公開 DTO / Wails method
- DB schema
- provider catalog

削除予定:
- なし
end note

@enduml
